      "value": "@{5b9f6c965a3e1a116727dfa8|full_name}: That is the avatar inspection stuff I mentioned. It's just warnings/information right now. Not really a system.\n\nIt has been said that someday there will be a Performance System that may act on those numbers. And this canny is basically asking for such a thing. But I am trying to just point out that it is not part of the Trust and Safty. And that it shouldn't be.",
