  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new update, avatars will be scored in their performance; however, if someone loads in a laggy avatar, all you can really do is block it outright. If they later switch to a less laggy avatar, you might not notice. And you have to do this all manually while you're at 20fps getting vertigo.\n\nIf, instead, a minimum performance level was added to the trust and safety system, laggy avatars could be automatically blocked. What's more, if the low perf rating is due to something which can be disabled gracefully, like lights, sounds, particles, colliders, etc, that component of the avatar could be disabled on its own instead of forcing the generic grey torso avatar.",
